# The Network: Certificate validation
#
# Expects DIRECT.
#
# OCSP responders and CRL and AIA hosts of the public CAs. A revocation check sits on the critical path of the TLS handshake that triggers it, and every one of these routed through the proxy in the 14 days to 2026-09-09 (ocsp.digicert.com 264 flows) while DigiCert's mainland responder ran direct with none failed (ocsp.digicert.cn 443 flows). The CAs serve these from anycast networks with mainland reach; Google's pki.goog does not and stays out. Apple's own responders live in Platforms/Apple.list and Microsoft's in Platforms/MicrosoftCDN.list.

